    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like exhaustion though. it feels like there's nothing left in the well. like the well is just dry stone now. what's the point of staying around to just... stare at the dry stone? it feels like the story is already over, i'm just waiting for the credits to roll.",
